ormat="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="3" id="_7eaa0758-e4db-44a6-aecf-ba3d9ab829c3">6,857</ix:nonFraction>&#160;</span></td><td style="background-color:#cceeff;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">Eyce 2021 Contingent Payment settlement in Class A common stock</span></td><td colspan="2" style="padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">(<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i2b5a6e974f654cdaaa1b406ad79c2c05_D20220101-20220331" decimals="-3" name="us-gaap:FairValueMeasurementWithUnobservableInputsReconciliationRecurringBasisLiabilitySettlements" scale="3" id="_d2e528cd-6bfb-4e79-9e45-98028ff129fb">875</ix:nonFraction>)</span></td><td style="padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">DaVinci 2021 Contingent Payment settlement in Class A common stock</span></td><td colspan="2" style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">(<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i26964378e5b44837ad2ea4f302a70ccc_D20220101-20220331" decimals="-3" name="us-gaap:FairValueMeasurementWithUnobservableInputsReconciliationRecurringBasisLiabilitySettlements" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="3" id="_b7f53407-d893-4172-a68d-b61d6cd24c88">2,611</ix:nonFraction>)</span></td><td style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">Gain from fair value adjustments included in results of operations</span></td><td colspan="2" style="padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">(<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i1bd554d449e741b49f01b2eae2a3d19a_D20220101-20220331" decimals="-3" name="us-gaap:FairValueMeasurementWithUnobservableInputsReconciliationRecurringBasisLiabilityGainLossIncludedInEarnings" scale="3" id="_2f8a13ea-ed84-4df2-81bf-6b504c1aff2e">5</ix:nonFraction>)</span></td><td style="padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">Balance March 31, 2022</span></td><td style="background-color:#cceeff;border-bottom:3pt double #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">$</span></td><td style="background-color:#cceeff;border-bottom:3pt double #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="iedddd041fea8417fa540f488c47cf87a_I20220331" decimals="-3" name="us-gaap:FairValueMeasurementWithUnobservableInputsReconciliationsRecurringBasisLiabilityValue" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="3" id="_04971831-5306-484a-8b4b-605a8cbac558">3,366</ix:nonFraction>&#160;</span></td><td style="background-color:#cceeff;border-bottom:3pt double #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"></td></tr></table></ix:continuation></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span><br/></span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Equity Securities Without a Readily Determinable Fair Value</span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span><br/></span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Our investment in equity securities without readily determinable fair value consist of ownership interests in Airgraft Inc., Sun Grown Packaging, LLC (&#8220;Sun Grown&#8221;) and Vapor Dosing Technologies, Inc. (&#8220;VIVA&#8221;). We determined that our ownership interests do not provide us with significant influence over the operations of these investments. Accordingly, we account for our investments in these entities as equity securities.</span></div><div><span><br/></span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Airgraft Inc., Sun Grown, and VIVA are private entities and their equity securities do not have a readily determinable fair value. We elected to measure these securities under the measurement alternative election at cost minus impairment, if any, with adjustments through earnings for observable price changes in orderly transactions for the identical or similar investment of the same issuer. We acquired our investments in Sun Grown and VIVA as part of our merger with KushCo, which we completed in August 2021. We did not identify any fair value adjustments related to these equity securities during the three months ended March 31, 2023 and 2022.</span></div><div><span><br/></span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">As of March&#160;31, 2023 and December&#160;31, 2022, the carrying value of our investment in equity securities without a readily determinable fair value was approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i6283f652021348b7b551db43841109d7_I20221231" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:EquitySecuritiesWithoutReadilyDeterminableFairValueAmount" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmY1Y2U1ODEyNTU4ZDRhNDNhODk3ZGQ0Y2UwMzg1ZjJmL3NlYzpmNWNlNTgxMjU1OGQ0YTQzYTg5N2RkNGNlMDM4NWYyZl80Ni9mcmFnOmE1Y2E3OGIzMWUzMjRiYTU4NzgwY2FhZjYwOTI5Y2IzL3RleHRyZWdpb246YTVjYTc4YjMxZTMyNGJhNTg3ODBjYWFmNjA5MjljYjNfNTY5NQ_8e3dd122-e2cb-4ffb-9160-065181b56d77"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="ib1b705f50d5242e3944c89abca102c40_I20230331" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:EquitySecuritiesWithoutReadilyDeterminableFairValueAmount" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmY1Y2U1ODEyNTU4ZDRhNDNhODk3ZGQ0Y2UwMzg1ZjJmL3NlYzpmNWNlNTgxMjU1OGQ0YTQzYTg5N2RkNGNlMDM4NWYyZl80Ni9mcmFnOmE1Y2E3OGIzMWUzMjRiYTU4NzgwY2FhZjYwOTI5Y2IzL3RleHRyZWdpb246YTVjYTc4YjMxZTMyNGJhNTg3ODBjYWFmNjA5MjljYjNfNTY5NQ_92a7f9aa-5f04-4dfc-b70c-e6c607f5e26d">2.5</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction>&#160;million, respectively, included within "Other assets" in our condensed consolidated balance sheets. The carrying value included a fair value adjustment of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i315ba4bc1459402eb7ad78c9aa8e255c_D20190101-20191231" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:EquitySecuritiesWithoutReadilyDeterminableFairValueUpwardPriceAdjustmentAnnualAmount" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmY1Y2U1ODEyNTU4ZDRhNDNhODk3ZGQ0Y2UwMzg1ZjJmL3NlYzpmNWNlNTgxMjU1OGQ0YTQzYTg5N2RkNGNlMDM4NWYyZl80Ni9mcmFnOmE1Y2E3OGIzMWUzMjRiYTU4NzgwY2FhZjYwOTI5Y2IzL3RleHRyZWdpb246YTVjYTc4YjMxZTMyNGJhNTg3ODBjYWFmNjA5MjljYjNfNTg0NQ_2324dc66-3e65-45b0-95e0-430104ec61ce">1.5</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million due to an observable price change recognized during the year ended December 31, 2019.</span></div></ix:continuation><div style="text-align:justify"><span><br/></span></div><div id="if5ce5812558d4a43a897dd4ce0385f2f_49"></div><div style="margin-top:10pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">NOTE 5. <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="i2b53804f8c224cad96a41927d374b89d_D20230101-20230331" name="us-gaap:LesseeOperatingLeasesTextBlock" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmY1Y2U1ODEyNTU4ZDRhNDNhODk3ZGQ0Y2UwMzg1ZjJmL3NlYzpmNWNlNTgxMjU1OGQ0YTQzYTg5N2RkNGNlMDM4NWYyZl80OS9mcmFnOmM4YTljNWJhOWNhNjQ2MWE5ZmRiNjBlNjhjMzFjZDgzL3RleHRyZWdpb246YzhhOWM1YmE5Y2E2NDYxYTlmZGI2MGU2OGMzMWNkODNfMTcyNw_8d184d0d-cd10-445e-aa02-1daf70d99ccc" continuedAt="i57bdb2c16ae240c185e8cda196f0807a" escape="true">LEASES</ix:nonNumeric></span></div><ix:continuation id="i57bdb2c16ae240c185e8cda196f0807a" continuedAt="i337a6596648e4a8bb382bf43aca9006a"><div style="margin-top:10pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Greenlane as a Lessee</span></div><div style="margin-top:10pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">As of March&#160;31, 2023, we had facilities financed under operating leases consisting of warehouses, offices, and a retail store, with lease term expirations from&#160;2023 to&#160;2027. Lease terms are generally <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmY1Y2U1ODEyNTU4ZDRhNDNhODk3ZGQ0Y2UwMzg1ZjJmL3NlYzpmNWNlNTgxMjU1OGQ0YTQzYTg5N2RkNGNlMDM4NWYyZl80OS9mcmFnOmM4YTljNWJhOWNhNjQ2MWE5ZmRiNjBlNjhjMzFjZDgzL3RleHRyZWdpb246YzhhOWM1YmE5Y2E2NDYxYTlmZGI2MGU2OGMzMWNkODNfMjMz_e674fb45-0054-4cff-a1a1-9480dba22189">three</span>&#160;to&#160;<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="i9cff3dcb0c6e4301afcf69838ecc6ff6_I20230331" name="us-gaap:LessorOperatingLeaseTermOfContract" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmY1Y2U1ODEyNTU4ZDRhNDNhODk3ZGQ0Y2UwMzg1ZjJmL3NlYzpmNWNlNTgxMjU1OGQ0YTQzYTg5N2RkNGNlMDM4NWYyZl80OS9mcmFnOmM4YTljNWJhOWNhNjQ2MWE5ZmRiNjBlNjhjMzFjZDgzL3RleHRyZWdpb246YzhhOWM1YmE5Y2E2NDYxYTlmZGI2MGU2OGMzMWNkODNfMjM5_0c56c030-23bf-4de2-8727-941b46c653a2">seven years</ix:nonNumeric>&#160;for warehouses, office space and retail store locations. Our lease agreements do not contain any material residual value guarantees or material restrictive covenants.</span></div><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="i2b53804f8c224cad96a41927d374b89d_D20230101-20230331" name="us-gaap:LesseeOperatingLeaseLiabilityMaturityTableTextBlock" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmY1Y2U1ODEyNTU4ZDRhNDNhODk3ZGQ0Y2UwMzg1ZjJmL3NlYzpmNWNlNTgxMjU1OGQ0YTQzYTg5N2RkNGNlMDM4NWYyZl80OS9mcmFnOmM4YTljNWJhOWNhNjQ2MWE5ZmRiNjBlNjhjMzFjZDgzL3RleHRyZWdpb246YzhhOWM1YmE5Y2E2NDYxYTlmZGI2MGU2OGMzMWNkODNfMTcyNA_10d34bc5-ce35-4dd3-961c-8a7780291e3e" escape="true"><div style="margin-top:10pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The following table provides details of our future minimum lease payments under finance and operating lease liabilities recorded in our condensed consolidated balance sheet as of March&#160;31, 2023. The table below does not include commitments that are contingent on events or other factors that are currently uncertain or unknown.</span></div><div style="margin-top:10pt;text-align:justify"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:100.000%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"></td><td style="width:76.531%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td colspan="3" style="display:none"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td>